<title>USA: No major cold foreseen in Brazil coffee belt - WSC.</title>
<headline>No major cold foreseen in Brazil coffee belt - WSC.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, Mass. 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>No major cold is in sight in Brazil's coffee areas, private forecaster Weather Services Corporation (WSC) said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Conditions will be clearer today and fair to partly cloudy on Thursday, with temperatures trending lower.</p>
<p>Friday to Sunday will be partly cloudy with near-normal to above-normal temperatures.</p>
</text>
